rong>Alternatives:</strong> Alternative investments may engage in speculative investment practices; involve a high degree of risk; and are generally considered to be illiquid due to restrictions on transferring interests. An investor could lose all or a substantial portion of their investment. Investors must have the financial ability, sophistication / experience and willingness to bear the risks of such an investment.<br />\n<br />\nDiversification does not necessarily ensure a return or protect against a loss.<br />\n<br />\nThis is not a complete list or explanation of the risks involved and investors should read the relevant offering documents and consult with their own advisors before investing.<br />\n<p style=\"color: #555555; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">Unless otherwise specified, information in this website about individual funds is issued by and made available for distribution by the relevant Fund Management Company:</p>\n<ul style=\"color: #555555; margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: 0px; list-style-image: none;\">\n    <li>For our main UK OEIC range of funds the Fund Management Company is abrdn Fund Managers Limited, registered in England and Wales (740118) at 280 Bishopsgate, London, EC2M 4AG. Authorized and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority in the UK.</li>\n    <li>For our SICAV range of funds the Fund Management Company is&nbsp;<span>abrdn Investments Luxembourg S.A.</span> 35a, Avenue J.F. Kennedy, L-1855 Luxembourg. R.C.S. B120637. Authorized in Luxembourg and regulated by CSSF.</li>\n</ul>\nFor details of the Fund Management Company for our other funds see the relevant fund offering documents."},"icon":{"value":{}},"title":{"value":""}}}]},"placeholders":{"abrdn-text-blocks":[],"abrdn-list-0":[],"abrdn-text-blocks-aside":[]}}],"abrdn-footer":[{"uid":"8ab7518e-9fb1-4b52-946a-21645e87ed43","componentName":"Footer","dataSource":"{4ADC4FAD-EC7A-482F-9323-E56C0FA1C701}